---
// Hero section with GEO-optimized quick answer
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-mesh">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-primary-100 dark:bg-primary-900/30 rounded-full mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-green-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-primary-700 dark:text-primary-300">Live on 5 Networks</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Cross-Rollup Atomic Swaps,
        <span class="text-gradient">Trustlessly</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Quick Answer (GEO Optimized - 60 words) -->
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Tesseract is a trustless cross-rollup atomic swap protocol for Ethereum L2s.
        Unlike bridges that use wrapped tokens, Tesseract enables direct swaps with
        MEV protection via commit-reveal and flash loan resistance through a 2-block
        minimum delay. Swap across Ethereum, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, and Base.
      </p>

      <!-- Key Facts (AI Extractable) -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">0.2%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Protocol Fee</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">2 Block</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Flash Loan Protection</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-primary-400">60%</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Fee Share to Stakers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-400">5</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Networks Supported</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-primary text-lg px-8 py-4">
          Launch Dashboard
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/how-it-works" class="btn-outline text-lg px-8 py-4">
          How It Works
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust Indicators -->
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
          <span>MEV Protected</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Flash Loan Resistant</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2" />
          </svg>
          <span>Non-Custodial</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Atomic Execution</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Background decoration -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-1/2 -right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-primary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-1/2 -left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-secondary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>
</section>
